---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy — Ozzyl Recipes" description="Privacy information for Ozzyl Recipes.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:820px">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="section-title">Privacy by design.</h1>
      <p class="section-copy">The current site uses Cloudflare's request-country metadata to prioritise recipes for a visitor's general market. This is country-level network information, not precise GPS location.</p>
      <p class="section-copy">When a visitor manually changes the market, the site stores a first-party cookie named <code>preferred_country</code> for up to one year. The cookie contains only the selected two-letter country code and can be removed through browser settings.</p>
      <p class="section-copy">Saved recipes, recipe drafts, shopping-list items, weekly meal plans, and cooking progress are currently stored only in the visitor's browser using local or session storage. These private tools do not send their contents to the Ozzyl Recipes server. Clearing site data in the browser removes them.</p>
      <p class="section-copy">The current foundation does not yet collect account information. Before authentication, analytics, advertising, newsletters, community publishing, or cross-device synchronisation are enabled, this page will be expanded with production data practices, retention rules, consent controls, and contact information.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
